\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Singapore \highlight\uc2  dlr falls, market wary of  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 295 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 April 2007\par 03:22\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 SINGAPORE\b0 \highlight\uc2 , April 11 (Reuters) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar fell on Wednesday, holding close to a three-week low hit the previous day when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was suspected of heavy U.S. dollar-buying in a bid to limit gains in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 Some dealers said it was possible that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Singapore, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , was in the market again in early Wednesday trade.   \par \par \uc2 At 0105 GMT, the Singapore dollar was trading at about 1.5200 to the U.S. dollar <SGD=>, close to a three-week low hit on Tuesday at 1.5215 and down 0.6 percent from a 9-\u189\'00\'BD year high hit earlier that session.   \par \par \uc2 Traders said they suspected that MAS had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market during Tuesday's London session after buying U.S. dollars in Asian trade.   \par \par \uc2 "They bought about 2.5 to 2.7 billion U.S. dollars in the global day yesterday and I think they are in again this morning," said one trader. "Agent banks have been on the bid from the 1.5175 area since 8 a.m. this morning."   \par \par \uc2 But another trader said it was likely that the market was covering short positions on the U.S. dollar.   \par \par \uc2 Stronger-than-expected economic growth and a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  decision to stick to a policy of modest \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  appreciation on Tuesday had boosted the \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar.   \par \par \uc2 Although suspected market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has stalled \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar gains, sentiment towards the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  remains bullish.   \par \par \uc2 "Because of strong inflows and optimism about Singapore, the only buyer of U.S. dollar/Sing at the moment seems to be the MAS," the first trader said.   \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-SINGAPORE-DOLLAR|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|SI|ABX|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070411e34b0001w\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
