\par\par \b \uc2 Singapore Dlr Flat, May Be At Edge Of Trading Band; Bonds Dn  \b0\par\par\uc2 301 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Februar 2007\par 08:34\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                         Latest   Change \par  USD/SGD                1.5334   -0.0007 \par  Overnight rate         2.88%     unch \par  Two-year bond yield:   2.91%    +3 bp \par  10-year bond yield:    3.23%    +5 bp \par  Two-year swap offer:   3.51%    +3 bp \par  10-year swap offer:    3.63%    +5 bp \par  2-10-year swap curve:  12 bps   +2 bp \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 SINGAPORE (Dow Jones)--The Singapore dollar moved sideways in Asian trade Friday, but analysts warned of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  as the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is at the strong end of its trading band.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 One local dealer said the trade-weighted \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar crossed the suspected lower threshold for triggering \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Feb. 12, but he added that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Singapore may not act unless the pair approaches the psychological S$1.5300 level.  \par \par \uc2 Activity was muted, in part because many market participants took the week off for the Chinese New Year holidays.  \par \par \uc2 "It's been dead for so long. There's really nothing," one local bank dealer said.  \par \par \uc2 A much smaller-than-expected rise in Singapore's consumer price index for January didn't affect the pair, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers expect the pair to trade between S$1.5280 and S$1.5400 next week.  \par \par \uc2 Singapore government bond prices fell, tracking U.S. Treasurys.  \par \par \uc2 The decline also reflected position adjustment ahead of a 20-year auction scheduled for Monday, according to Selena Ling, head of Treasury Research at Overseas Chinese Banking Corp.  \par \par \uc2 She said that with a lack of U.S. data, all eyes would be on the auction.  \par \par \uc2 "Demand should be OK," Ling said.  \par \par \uc2 -By Wei Yi Lim, Dow Jones Newswires; 65-6415-4036; weiyi.lim@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Michael Kitchen [ 23-02-07 0734GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 1163 1859  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020070223e32n00081\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
