\par\par \b \uc2 Singapore Dlr Steady As FOMC As Expected; Bonds Up  \b0\par\par\uc2 546 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Dezember 2006\par 09:35\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                        Latest   Change \par  USD/SGD               1.5392   -0.0005 \par  Overnight rates       3.00%    -13bps \par  Two-year bond yield:  2.90%    -4 bps \par  10-year bond yield:   3.02%    -1 bp \par  Two-year swap offer:  3.28%    -6 bps \par  10-year swap offer:   3.33%    -6 bps \par  2-10-year swap curve: +5 bps   unch \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 SINGAPORE (Dow Jones)--The Singapore dollar was steady in Asian trade Wednesday after the Federal Open Market Committee again left interest rates unchanged. That will likely leave the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rangebound, as market activity wanes prior to the year-end holiday.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 The Fed announced Tuesday that the U.S. policy rate would stay steady at 5.25%, the fourth consecutive pause after 17 straight increases.  \par \par \uc2 One foreign bank analyst said market players now have lower expectations for the \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar since the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily two weeks ago to hold the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  down.  \par \par \uc2 "That was probably the last wave of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the year," the analyst said. "There may be some players who are interested to have the Singapore dollar leap back to the higher levels seen last week, but liquidity of the Singapore dollar will have to surge by the end of the year to see that kind of level again."  \par \par \uc2 But that is unlikely, as "the year is closing and hence, the market is thinning," said one local bank dealer.  \par \par \uc2 Last Thursday, the Singapore dollar reached its highest intraday level in nine years at S$1.5364.  \par \par \uc2 The analyst said the Singapore dollar's trading band is now "moving away from the persistent strength and has found a new, comfortable, lower level."  \par \par \uc2 But the local bank dealer said that while the Singapore dollar may not be as strong as it was last week, the greenback is still relatively heavy, and there are still heavy Singapore dollar inflows.  \par \par \uc2 "Besides the casino-resort-linked inflows, there are Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  inflows across the board," he said.  \par \par \uc2 Traders expect inflows for financing the multi-billion-dollar casino-resort that was awarded Friday to Genting International (G13.SG) and its consortium partner Star Cruises Ltd. (S21.SG), both units of Malaysian gaming company Genting Bhd. (3182.KU).  \par \par \uc2 The local bank dealer expects resistance for the U.S. dollar at S$1.5420, and support at a "risky" S$1.5300 for the rest of the week.  \par \par \uc2 In the Singapore bond market, prices were up slightly, tracking U.S. Treasurys, with traders echoing the view that there is no story in the local bond market for this year.  \par \par \uc2 "There's really nothing" said one local bank dealer.  \par \par \uc2 However, he said the 20-year bond auction, likely to be held in February next year, would be noteworthy.  \par \par \uc2 "It's the first issue of the extended yield curve, so it's anyone's guess on how it would perform," the dealer said. "For such a long-term bond, it will usually attract investors and foreign funds, so it will be interesting to judge the foreign demand."  \par \par \uc2 "For the rest of this year, just keep watching the U.S. Treasurys," he said.  \par \par \uc2 -By Wei Yi Lim, Dow Jones Newswires; 65-6415-4036; weiyi.lim@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Paul Baylis [ 13-12-06 0835GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 1163 1859  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020061213e2cd000kl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
